   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## z-image-turbo.json\n\nZ-Image Turbo base art\n\nU3 - Z-Image Turbo (6B, Apache 2.0) - the licence-clean base model that FITS this box. 11.46 GB bf16 + 5.25 GB Qwen3-4B fp8 encoder + Flux ae.safetensors VAE. 8 steps, cfg 1.0, res_multistep/simple, ModelSamplingAuraFlow shift 3. CLIPLoader type is 'lumina2' (NOT qwen_image) - Z-Image is Lumina-derived. Negative is ConditioningZeroOut (turbo: no negative prompt). Measured: 25 s at 1024x1024, cgroup peak 19.3 GB, zero OOM events, no throttling. STYLE CAVEAT: far more photoreal than RealVisXL/SDXL at the same prompt+seed - better materials and fine detail, but NOT the painted concept-art look. Needs a style prompt/LoRA for stylised game art; it is a different tool, not a drop-in upgrade.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S1** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **U3** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
